ta-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;that was far higher than that of followers.</p><p>Companies that always aim at excellence may miss opportunities.</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/cambridge-ielts-12-academic-listening-1-audio-4.mp3"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-c12-t1-l-q1","part_id":"en-c12-t1-l-p1","group_id":"en-c12-t1-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"table_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"mountains","correct_answer_variants":["mountains"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_12112_1","order_index":1,"points":1},{"id":"en-c12-t1-l-q2","part_id":"en-c12-t1-l-p1","group_id":"en-c12-t1-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"table_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"horse","correct_answer_variants":["horse"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[2],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_12112_2","order_index":2,"points":1},{"id":"en-c12-t1-l-q3","part_id":"en-c12-t1-l-p1","group_id":"en-c12-t1-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"table_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"garden/gardens","correct_answer_variants":["garden","gardens"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[3],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_12112_3","order_index":3,"points":1},{"id":"en-c12-t1-l-q4","part_id":"en-c12-t1-l-p1","group_id":"en-c12-t1-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType